{"unit_id":"whitefirer__dsh-browser-fs#card-zh","repo":"whitefirer/dsh-browser-fs","commit":"2568a800bf6a045703ad00a2072c881bc2c204ac","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-browser-fs 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的浏览器文件访问插件。它在网页提供授权卡片，并通过 WebSocket 把 agent 注册的文件工具调用转给持有授权目录的浏览器标签页。主要功能包括列出目录、读取 UTF-8 文本、写入文本，以及在卡片中浏览和预览文件。完整模式可读写；浏览器不支持目录句柄时可选择文件并以只读兼容模式访问。适合需要让远程 DSH 会话处理浏览器所在设备文件的用户。使用时需在网页中选择授权目录，不需要 API 密钥或外部账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:413-520","src/client/index.ts:408-415","src/client/files-backend.ts:97-169"]}
{"unit_id":"whitefirer__dsh-browser-fs#card-en","repo":"whitefirer/dsh-browser-fs","commit":"2568a800bf6a045703ad00a2072c881bc2c204ac","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-browser-fs lets a DSH agent list, read, and write files in a browser-authorized directory. It relays calls to the browser tab. The web panel supports directory selection and file preview. Full mode reads and writes; compatibility mode is read-only. Choose a directory; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:413-520","src/client/index.ts:408-415","src/client/files-backend.ts:97-169"]}
