{"unit_id":"whitefirer__dsh-browser-fs#feature-1","repo":"whitefirer/dsh-browser-fs","commit":"2568a800bf6a045703ad00a2072c881bc2c204ac","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-browser-fs 的功能「列出授权目录」：agent 可请求列出根目录或相对路径下的文件与目录，也可递归遍历；结果附文件大小及截断状态。通过 browser_fs_list 工具触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:413-463","src/client/fs.ts:128-161"]}
{"unit_id":"whitefirer__dsh-browser-fs#feature-2","repo":"whitefirer/dsh-browser-fs","commit":"2568a800bf6a045703ad00a2072c881bc2c204ac","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-browser-fs 的功能「读取文本文件」：agent 调用 browser_fs_read 并传入相对路径，可读取 UTF-8 内容；默认最多读取 256 KiB，超出会返回截断标记和原文件大小。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:465-499","src/client/fs.ts:184-194"]}
{"unit_id":"whitefirer__dsh-browser-fs#feature-3","repo":"whitefirer/dsh-browser-fs","commit":"2568a800bf6a045703ad00a2072c881bc2c204ac","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-browser-fs 的功能「写入文本文件」：agent 调用 browser_fs_write，提供相对路径和 UTF-8 文本；缺少的父目录会创建，已有文件会覆盖，并返回写入字节数。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:501-520","src/client/fs.ts:196-214"]}
{"unit_id":"whitefirer__dsh-browser-fs#feature-4","repo":"whitefirer/dsh-browser-fs","commit":"2568a800bf6a045703ad00a2072c881bc2c204ac","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-browser-fs 的功能「浏览器授权与目录浏览」：用户在 Web 卡片选择目录后，可浏览各级条目并查看文件预览；完整模式记住目录句柄，兼容模式通过选择文件提供只读访问。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:307-328","src/client/index.ts:452-462","src/client/files-backend.ts:97-99"]}
{"unit_id":"whitefirer__dsh-browser-fs#caveat-1","repo":"whitefirer/dsh-browser-fs","commit":"2568a800bf6a045703ad00a2072c881bc2c204ac","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-browser-fs 使用前须知：浏览器目录句柄不可用时会进入兼容模式，该模式只读；选择的文件刷新页面后需要重新选择。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:6-11","src/client/files-backend.ts:2-7"]}
